Cell["\<\
We need to determine the correction term on a smaller stretch of the \
interface as the interfaces are too short to measure the full stretch at a \
certain distance away from the junction.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.896434684087996*^9, 3.8964347839188137`*^9}, {
   3.896438978938531*^9, 3.896438979280707*^9}, 
